#: colorscm.cpp:100
msgid ""
"<h1>Colors</h1> This module allows you to choose the color scheme used for the "
"KDE desktop. The different elements of the desktop, such as title bars, menu "
"text, etc., are called \"widgets\". You can choose the widget whose color you "
"want to change by selecting it from a list, or by clicking on a graphical "
"representation of the desktop."
"<p> You can save color settings as complete color schemes, which can also be "
"modified or deleted. KDE comes with several predefined color schemes on which "
"you can base your own."
"<p> All KDE applications will obey the selected color scheme. Non-KDE "
"applications may also obey some or all of the color settings, if this option is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Töslär</h1> KDE östäle öçen qullanası töslär köyläwen bu modul aşa saylap "
"bula. Östälneñ başlıqtirä, saylaq yazması kebek öleşläre \"widget\" itep atala. "
"Tösen üzgärtäse öleşen bondağı tezmädan dä saylap bula, östäge küzläp alu "
"sürätenä çirtü aşa da saylap bula."
"<p> Töslär köyläwen berär ayırım töslär tözeleşe itep tä saqlap bula, alarnı "
"şulay uq üzgärtep tä, beterep tä bula. KDE belän bergä kilüçe töslär köyläwläre "
"asılında üz köyläwlären yasap bula."
"<p> KDE yazılımnarı bu saylanğan töslär köyläwen qullana. Kiräk itep äytelsä, "
"KDE-bulmağan yazılımnar da bu töslär köyläwlären qullana ala."

#: colorscm.cpp:133
msgid ""
"This is a preview of the color settings which will be applied if you click "
"\"Apply\" or \"OK\". You can click on different parts of this preview image. "
"The widget name in the \"Widget color\" box will change to reflect the part of "
"the preview image you clicked."
msgstr ""
"Bonda kürsätelgän töslär köyläwe \"Aşır\" yä ki \"OK\" töymälärenä çirtkändä "
"qullanuğa keräçäk. Bu aldan kürsätü sürätenä çirtkändä törle öleşlar saylanğan "
"bula, ul çaqta \"Widget tese\" digän tezmä kereme dä saylanğan öleşkä qarap "
"üzgäreläçäk."

#: colorscm.cpp:145
msgid "Color Scheme"
msgstr "Tös Köyläwe"

#: colorscm.cpp:154
msgid ""
"This is a list of predefined color schemes, including any that you may have "
"created. You can preview an existing color scheme by selecting it from the "
"list. The current scheme will be replaced by the selected color scheme."
"<p> Warning: if you have not yet applied any changes you may have made to the "
"current scheme, those changes will be lost if you select another color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Aldan bilgelängän töstözeleşlär tezmäse bu, üz yasağannarı da bonda uq. Alar "
"arasınnan berärsen saylap, anıñ küreneşen kürep alırğa bula. Ağımdağı "
"töztozeleş bonda saylanğanı belän almaşınaçaq."
"<p> Belderü: biredäge köyläw saqlanmağan ikän, başqa töstözeleş saylanğan "
"çaqta, biredägenä kertelğan üzgäreşlär yuğalaçaq."

#: colorscm.cpp:162
msgid "&Save Scheme..."
msgstr "Tözeleşne &Saqlaw..."

#: colorscm.cpp:165
msgid ""
"Press this button if you want to save the current color settings as a color "
"scheme. You will be prompted for a name."
msgstr ""
"Ağımdağı tös köyläwen ayırım tös tözeleşe itep saqlaw öçen bu töymägä çirtäse. "
"Berär atama soralaçaq."

#: colorscm.cpp:169
msgid "R&emove Scheme"
msgstr "Tözeleşne &Beter"

#: colorscm.cpp:173
msgid ""
"Press this button to remove the selected color scheme. Note that this button is "
"disabled if you do not have permission to delete the color scheme."
msgstr ""
"Saylanğan tös tözeleşen beterü öçen bu töymägä çirtäse. Töslär tözeleşen "
"betererlek xoquqlar citmägän çaqta bu töymä sünek toraçaq."

#: colorscm.cpp:177
msgid "I&mport Scheme..."
msgstr "&Tözeleş Yökläw..."

#: colorscm.cpp:180
msgid ""
"Press this button to import a new color scheme. Note that the color scheme will "
"only be available for the current user."
msgstr ""
"Tös tözeleşeneñ yañasın yökläw öçen bu töymägä çirtäse. Bonı beläse: ul töslär "
"tözeleşe biredäge qullanuçığa ğına qullanırlıq bulaçaq."

#: colorscm.cpp:188
msgid "&Widget Color"
msgstr "&Widget Töse"

