#: colorscm.cpp:227
msgid ""
"Click here to select an element of the KDE desktop whose color you want to "
"change. You may either choose the \"widget\" here, or click on the "
"corresponding part of the preview image above."
msgstr ""
"KDE östäleneñ berär öleşenä çirtep, anıñ tösen üzgärtep bula. Ul öleşne bondağı "
"tezmädan dä saylap bula, östäge küzläp alu sürätenä çirtü aşa da saylap bula."

#: colorscm.cpp:238
msgid ""
"Click here to bring up a dialog box where you can choose a color for the "
"\"widget\" selected in the above list."
msgstr ""
"Boña çirtüdän soñ çığuçı täräzäneñ tezmäsendä bu widget öçen tös saylap bula."

#: colorscm.cpp:242
msgid "Shade sorted column in lists"
msgstr "Tezmä tezü buyın yaqtırtası"

#: colorscm.cpp:247
msgid ""
"Check this box to show the sorted column in a list with a shaded background"
msgstr "Bu tezmäneñ tärtip buyın başqaça tösläw öçen bu bayraqnı quyası."

#: colorscm.cpp:249
msgid "Con&trast"
msgstr "&Kiskenlek"

#: colorscm.cpp:262
msgid ""
"Use this slider to change the contrast level of the current color scheme. "
"Contrast does not affect all of the colors, only the edges of 3D objects."
msgstr ""
"Ağımdağı töstözeleşneñ kiskenlegen üzgärtü öçen bu şudırmanı qullanası. "
"Kiskenlek bar töslärgä dä timi, ni barı tırpayğan cisem çiklärenä genä."

